{ His queen is deep in your camp on a two. Count the squares she has. } 19... g6 20. Ra1 { The rook attacks her, and there is nowhere for her to go. [%csl Ra2] } (20. Rb1 { Almost right. But from b one she slips out to a four. } 20... Qa4 21. Ra1 Qb5 22. Ng1 b6 { She got away. }) (20. Ng1 { A knight retreat, and she simply runs. } 20... a5 21. Ne2 Qa4 22. Ra1 Qb5 { She is safe now. }) 20... Qxa1 21. Rxa1 { She had to take the rook, and you take her back. A queen for a rook. } (21. Ng1 { You forget to take her back. } 21... Qa4 22. Ne2 O-O 23. Ng3 Ng7 { A whole rook for nothing. }) (21. Rc1 { The wrong rook, and the queen lives. } 21... Qa4 22. Qh2 O-O 23. Qh1 Qc6 { You had her. }) 1-0


